    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont think i can even do that. even the \"small stones\" feel like they're part of a collapse. everything is just so heavy. i look at my life and i just see this massive, endless cycle of sucking the air out of the room for everyone else. honestly, it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise and the pressure is to just... not be part of it anymore. like, why is everyone so obsessed with keeping the struggle going when there's no light at the end of it?",
